{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t天文台表示，乾燥的東北季候風，正影響廣東沿岸。本港今早市區氣溫，降至18度左右。<br/>\n<br/>\n由於天朗氣清及風勢較弱，新界部分地區輻射冷卻較為明顯，氣溫降至12度或以下。<br/>\n<br/>\n天文台預測今日天晴乾燥，早上稍涼，日間最高氣溫約25度。吹和緩北至東北風。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:47:39.917022+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:14:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:54.054058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:41:11.795145+00:00","content_hash":"43f1edc9bb1137668febf18b2e122622ca4b0ac8afba4744dfbaaaecb1544408","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}